{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52071","headline":"四言曲池酺饮座铭 · 郑元璹","name":"四言曲池酺饮座铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离酺将促，远就池台。\n酒随欢至，花逐风来。\n鹤归波动，鱼跃萍开。\n人生所盛，何过乐哉。\n（《翰林学士集》）（按：此诗原署「沛公郑元璹」。\n张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收此诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑元璹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52071.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52071","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}